  https://github.com/microsoft/DNS-Challenge
  Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
  (CC BY 4.0). Unmodified.
  Reference: C. K. A. Reddy, V. Gopal, R. Cutler, "DNSMOS P.835: A
  non-intrusive perceptual objective speech quality metric to evaluate noise
  suppressors", ICASSP 2022.

Audiobox Aesthetics (optional: the voice-quality model for speech over music)
  https://github.com/facebookresearch/audiobox-aesthetics, Copyright (c) Meta
  Platforms, Inc. and affiliates. Licensed under the Creative Commons
  Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0); its WavLM code comes from
  Microsoft's unilm (MIT License). The graph in
